---
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/docs-site.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>404 Not Found - dragon</title>
    <meta name="description" content="お探しのページが見つかりませんでした。" />
  </head>
  <body class="docs-body">
    <header class="docs-navbar">
      <div class="docs-navbar-inner">
        <a href="/docs" class="docs-navbar-brand">
          <span class="docs-navbar-logo">C</span>
          <span class="docs-navbar-title">cdl <span class="docs-navbar-title-sub">engine Docs</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="docs-navbar-nav" aria-label="docs navigation">
          <a href="/docs" class="docs-navbar-link">Introduction</a>
          <a href="/docs/cdl/overview/quickstart" class="docs-navbar-link">Guide</a>
          <a href="/docs/cdl/reference/api" class="docs-navbar-link">Reference</a>
          <a href="/catalog" class="docs-navbar-link">Catalog</a>
          <a href="/" class="docs-navbar-link docs-navbar-link-external">サイト</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/cardene777/cdl" class="docs-navbar-link docs-navbar-link-external" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="docs-404">
      <div class="docs-404-inner">
        <div class="docs-404-code">404</div>
        <h1 class="docs-404-title">ページが見つかりません</h1>
        <p class="docs-404-lead">
          お探しのページは移動 / 削除されたか、 そもそも存在しないようです。
        </p>
        <div class="docs-404-links">
          <a href="/docs" class="docs-hero-cta-primary">Docs トップへ</a>
          <a href="/docs/cdl/overview/quickstart" class="docs-hero-cta-secondary">Quickstart を読む</a>
          <a href="/" class="docs-hero-cta-secondary">サイトトップへ</a>
        </div>
        <div class="docs-404-suggest">
          <h3>探していたのはこれですか？</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/docs/cdl/README">@cardenelabs/cdl Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="/docs/cdl/primitives/README">Primitives (lane / node / edge / state / phase)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/docs/cdl/presets/README">Presets (sequence / er / state-machine 等)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/docs/cdl/patterns/README">Patterns (Permit / Bridge / DEX 等)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/catalog">Catalog (見本 78 種)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
